  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance component of the Regional Credit Enhancement Facility (RCEF) of the Caribbean Development Bank (CDB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;div class=&quot;quill-better-table-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;quill-better-table&quot;&gt;&lt;colgroup&gt;&lt;col width=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/colgroup&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr data-row=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-row=&quot;1&quot; rowspan=&quot;1&quot; colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;qlbt-cell-line&quot; data-row=&quot;1&quot; data-cell=&quot;1&quot; data-rowspan=&quot;1&quot; data-colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;To provide the CDB with technical assistance support in the implementation of the EFSD+ guarantee for the Regional Credit Enhancement Facility (RCEF).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-row=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-row=&quot;2&quot; rowspan=&quot;1&quot; colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;qlbt-cell-line&quot; data-row=&quot;2&quot; data-cell=&quot;1&quot; data-rowspan=&quot;1&quot; data-colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;This contract is the &#xbf;shell&#xbf; contribution agreement for the Technical Assistance (TA) for the implementation of the Regional Credit Enhancement Facility (RCEF) which will be signed with the Caribbean Development Bank.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;qlbt-cell-line&quot; data-row=&quot;2&quot; data-cell=&quot;1&quot; data-rowspan=&quot;1&quot; data-colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Its main objective is to secure the funds allocated to TA activities for this Proposed Investment Programme (PIP), already approved by the EFSD+ Operational Board in 2022 and which is expected to be signed in 1Q2024. The negotiations of the PIP are now at term sheet stage (1&lt;sup&gt;st&lt;/sup&gt; version received on 30 Nov 2023).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;qlbt-cell-line&quot; data-row=&quot;2&quot; data-cell=&quot;1&quot; data-rowspan=&quot;1&quot; data-colspan=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Annex I and Annex III of the &#xbf;shell&#xbf; contribution agreement must be amended after the signature of the EFSD+ guarantee agreement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
